  "section": {
   "page": "─── Form ────────────",
   "label": "Form"
  },
  "description": {
   "text": "# Purpose\nThe standard single-line text entry field for **free-form text input** across the product — from search to form fields to settings entries.\n\n# Use when\n- Collecting any single string value: name, email, URL, quantity, search query\n- The answer is open-ended and does not need to resolve into structured values\n\n# Don't use when\n- Multiple independent values are needed — use `TagInput`\n- Input is a **fixed-length code** (OTP, PIN) — use `PinInput`\n- Multi-line input is required — use a textarea variant\n\n# Content guidelines\n- **Label**: sentence case, noun or short noun phrase (\"Email address\", not \"Please enter your email address\")\n- **Placeholder**: use only when the format is non-obvious (e.g. \"name@company.com\")\n- **Helper text**: one line max; explains constraints before the user types\n- **Error message**: be specific (\"Must be at least 8 characters\", not \"Invalid input\")\n\n# Related\n- Use `PinInput` for fixed-length codes\n- Use `TagInput` for multi-value entry\n- Pair with `LargeTextInputLeftItem`, `MediumTextInputLeftItem`, or `SmallTextInputLeftItem` for left-slot content\n- Pair with `LargeTextInputRightItem`, `MediumTextInputRightItem`, or `SmallTextInputRightItem` for right-slot content",
   "source": "description",
   "empty": false
  },
